{"root":"percik","ipa":"/pərˈtʃɪk/","core":"意为“溅”、“泼”、“飞溅”，指液体微滴散开或撒落的状态。","pos":["动词","名词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/pərˈtʃɪk/","zh":"溅，飞溅，微滴","phrases":[{"t":"percik air","zh":"水花"},{"t":"percik darah","zh":"血迹"},{"t":"terkena percik","zh":"被溅到"}],"examples":[{"t":"Ada percik air di lantai.","zh":"地板上有水溅出来的痕迹。"},{"t":"Percik minyak panas itu mengenai tangannya.","zh":"那热油的溅射溅到了他的手上。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"percik","ipa":"/pərˈtʃɪk/","zh":"溅，飞溅","phrase":{"t":"percik kecil","zh":"小水滴"},"example":{"t":"Percik hujan masuk melalui jendela.","zh":"雨水从窗户溅了进来。"}},{"w":"berpercikan","ipa":"/bər.pərˈtʃɪk.an/","zh":"四处飞溅","phrase":{"t":"air berpercikan","zh":"水花四溅"},"example":{"t":"Lumpur berpercikan ke mana-mana saat mobil itu lewat.","zh":"那辆车开过时，泥浆四处飞溅。"}},{"w":"memercik","ipa":"/məˈmər.tʃɪk/","zh":"溅落，泼洒","phrase":{"t":"memercik ke dinding","zh":"溅到墙上"},"example":{"t":"Cat itu memercik ke lantai.","zh":"油漆溅到了地板上。"}},{"w":"memerciki","ipa":"/məˈmər.tʃi.ki/","zh":"向...泼水，点缀","phrase":{"t":"memerciki bunga","zh":"给花洒水"},"example":{"t":"Dia memerciki pakaian dengan air sebelum disetrika.","zh":"他在熨衣服前先向衣服上洒了些水。"}},{"w":"memercikkan","ipa":"/məˈmər.tʃɪk.kan/","zh":"使...溅出，泼","phrase":{"t":"memercikkan air","zh":"泼水"},"example":{"t":"Ibu memercikkan air suci ke ruangan itu.","zh":"母亲把圣水洒在那个房间里。"}},{"w":"terpercik","ipa":"/tərˈpər.tʃɪk/","zh":"被溅到，无意中溅出","phrase":{"t":"terpercik minyak","zh":"被油溅到"},"example":{"t":"Kemejanya terpercik kopi.","zh":"他的衬衫溅上了咖啡。"}},{"w":"percikan","ipa":"/pərˈtʃɪk.an/","zh":"飞溅物，火花，水花","phrase":{"t":"percikan api","zh":"火星"},"example":{"t":"Percikan api dari las mengenai kayu.","zh":"焊接产生的火花落在了木头上。"}}],"derSlugs":["percik","berpercikan","memercik","memerciki","memercikkan","terpercik","percikan"],"model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-28T09:46:53.741Z","src":"base"}